  "scope": "Executed host history/penalty/state and pristine/ON/OFF numerical/grammar/MTP fixtures. NOT-INFERENCE; no model forward, original-weight GPU continuation, memory fit or performance qualification.",
  "implementation": [
    "Model-neutral C17 ABI1 owns bounded prompt-tail history, sorted unique penalties, generated-token frequency/presence counts and repetition flags. Caller owns growth, budgets and disposal; C creates no threads/device calls or retained input pointers.",
    "Reset counts prompt only for repetition; accept counts all committed generated tokens even outside the window. Overflow, invalid input, budget and growth refusal preserve logical state. Independent copy does not change RNG or grammar.",
    "Single-token acceptance stages no scratch. Bulk generation stages at most input count; repetition-only input stages the retained tail. In-place heapsort needs no libc sort allocation outside caller budgets.",
    "Exact pinned history recipe wires provider construction/reset/acceptance/free-distribution bookkeeping. Transient C++ glue grows live vector entries and shrinks unpublished scratch; ON/OFF layouts stay equal. OFF preserves pinned bookkeeping.",
    "Provider grammar is staged before C acceptance and published after success; deferred draws/RNG keep existing ownership. Free penalty construction does not acquire random entropy. Six owned sampling files and the additional history recipe are receipt-verified.",
    "No new runtime thread, Python product/default CTest dependency, model payload or DS4 prefix-format change. Grammar/masking and compact speculative distributions remain delegated."
  ],
  "coverage": [
    "14400 independent FIFO/count oracle transitions cover generated/repetition flags, windows0/1/2/8/64/129, empty/single/8/32/33/257-token batches, prompt-tail reset and clone independence.",
    "Growth/refusal fixtures cover reset/accept/copy failure without publishing, budget caps, smaller reset windows, overlapping/invalid input, UINT32_MAX generated count overflow and repetition-only eviction at the unique-token cap.",
    "1728 complete history transitions over48 profiles compare all entries, flags, RNG/deferred draws, cloned state, resets, free and compact distributions byte-exactly with pristine Gufo and OFF; grammar-refused batches preserve state.",
    "1200 existing complete numerical cases,1200 bias cases,24 full-vocabulary cases and nine upstream logit/grammar/MTP fixtures pass; these are synthetic host rows, not model inference.",
    "Final17 Debug,17 ASan/UBSan/LeakSanitizer shared-contract checks,15 sanitizer reference-project checks and33 C++ public headers pass. All test assertions and leak detection stay active.",
    "Strict C17 warning-as-error syntax passes; object imports are only stack protector and memcpy/memmove, with no allocator/sort/thread/device symbol."
  ],
